<SiteLayout title="File Conversion, Subtitle & Image Editing Guides | ConvertAnyFile" description="Practical browser-based guides for subtitle conversion, SRT, VTT, ASS, SBV, timing and encoding, plus image formats, watermark editing, archives, CSV, JSON and private local workflows.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="site-container hero-inner"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Guides</span></div><span class="eyebrow">Practical guides</span><h1>Understand the file or edit before you run it.</h1><p>Practical explanations for subtitle formats and timing, visible image editing, compatibility, compression, archive containers, and structured data — tied to real local tools.</p></div></section>
<section class="content-wide-section"><div class="site-container"><div class="content-intro-grid"><div class="section-heading wide"><span class="section-kicker">Why these guides exist</span><h2>Useful tools are easier when the trade-offs are clear.</h2><p>A converter or image editor can run in seconds, but the right result depends on compatibility, structure, compression, subtitle metadata, timing, encoding, mask placement, and what the next application expects. These guides explain those decisions before you process a batch.</p></div><div class="content-summary-card"><strong>People-first content</strong><p>Each guide is tied to a working ConvertAnyFile tool or a real format decision. The goal is useful product education, not thin pages created only to repeat keywords.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="content-wide-section white"><div class="site-container"><div class="section-heading wide"><span class="section-kicker">Current guides</span><h2>Start with the problem you are trying to solve.</h2><p>Subtitle compatibility and timing now sit alongside image editing, image formats, archive containers, compression behavior, and structured-data choices.</p></div><div class="category-grid">{guides.map((guide)=><a class="category-card category-card--live" href={guide.href}><div class="category-icon">G</div><div><span class="live-badge">Guide</span><h3>{guide.title}</h3><p>{guide.text}</p></div><span class="category-arrow">→</span></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="content-wide-section"><div class="site-container"><div class="section-heading wide"><span class="section-kicker">Subtitle starting points</span><h2>Choose the subtitle problem first.</h2></div><div class="comparison-table-wrap"><table class="comparison-table"><thead><tr><th>Your task</th><th>Best starting guide</th><th>Useful tool</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Web video needs VTT</td><td><a href="/guides/how-to-convert-srt-to-vtt/">SRT to VTT guide</a></td><td><a href="/srt-to-vtt/">SRT to VTT</a></td></tr><tr><td>App or player needs SRT</td><td><a href="/guides/how-to-convert-vtt-to-srt/">VTT to SRT guide</a></td><td><a href="/vtt-to-srt/">VTT to SRT</a></td></tr><tr><td>Subtitles are early or late</td><td><a href="/guides/how-to-shift-subtitle-timing/">Timing shift guide</a></td><td><a href="/subtitle-converter/">Subtitle Converter</a></td></tr><tr><td>You only need readable dialogue</td><td><a href="/guides/subtitle-to-plain-text/">Subtitle to plain text guide</a></td><td><a href="/srt-to-txt/">SRT to TXT</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>
<section class="content-wide-section white"><div class="site-container"><div class="section-heading wide"><span class="section-kicker">Image editing starting points</span><h2>Choose the focused workflow first.</h2></div><div class="comparison-table-wrap"><table class="comparison-table"><thead><tr><th>Your task</th><th>Best starting guide</th><th>Useful tool</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Visible Gemini sparkle watermark</td><td><a href="/guides/how-to-remove-gemini-watermark-from-image/">Gemini watermark removal guide</a></td><td><a href="/gemini-ai-logo-remover/">Gemini Watermark Remover</a></td></tr><tr><td>General visible watermark</td><td><a href="/guides/how-to-remove-watermark-from-image/">Watermark removal guide</a></td><td><a href="/remove-watermark/">Remove Watermark</a></td></tr><tr><td>Visible word, number, or phrase</td><td><a href="/guides/how-to-remove-text-watermark-from-image/">Text watermark guide</a></td><td><a href="/remove-watermark/">Text mask</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>
